    "summary": "`good-pin-input` collects a short code in a row of large slots. It uses one native input behind the slots, so keyboard selection, paste, browser one-time-code autofill, and mobile keyboards work as one field. Clicking a slot moves the caret to that position. A long code scrolls horizontally inside the control.",
